The following database {{PLURAL:$2|type is|types are}} supported: $1.

If you compiled PHP yourself, reconfigure it with a database client enabled, for example, using <code>./configure --with-mysqli</code>.
If you installed PHP from a Debian or Ubuntu package, then you also need to install, for example, the <code>php-mysql</code> package.',
